        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Canadian Hot 100, singles, LP records, albums, EP records\n- Companies: Billboard magazine\n- Places: Canada\n- Concepts: music industry record charts, music releases\n\nFacts:\n- The Canadian Hot 100 is a weekly music industry record chart for singles in Canada.\n- Billboard magazine publishes the Canadian Hot 100.\n- In music, a single is a type of release that usually contains fewer tracks than an LP record, an album, or an EP record.\n- In most cases, a single is released separately from an album.\n- A single usually also appears on an album.",
